      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Adventurers! There's trouble!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: What happened, meow? Did the goat come back?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: Rat Village, it's on fire! Please, help our neighbours!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: On fire, meow?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: Yes! I would help them myself but we're still trying to solve the brainwashing
        mayhem here...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: 'You''re the only ones that can help! Please, head over to Rat Village,
        quickly! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: Looks like the cheese will have to wait.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: We better get paid well for this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: A beast, meow?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: Yes! A terribly dangerous beast! You should avoid it if you can!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: Where can we find it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: Usually it lives way high up at the top of the mountain. But conveniently
        at the moment it's taking a nap just over there past the end of our village.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: "You will find it if you follow the path... Oh but you shouldn\u2019t
        approach it, it\u2019s too dangerous!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: "When you said \u201Cone of our pigs\u201D, did you mean, like\u2026
        One of you? or, like, livestock pigs?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: "But if you do wish to approach the beast, be careful. We\u2019ve tried
        to combat it I assure you! But its strength is insurmountable..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[15].Text
      value: "I don\u2019t trust these guys..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[16].Text
      value: "We\u2019ll take a look, thanks for the information."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Character
      value: 
